      "detailed_description": "<h1>♥♥ ADD IN WISHLIST!! ♥♥</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185760/extras/91fecccf7b712bc438f1d90ae51996b5.poster.avif?t=1768902689\" width=600 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185760/extras/91fecccf7b712bc438f1d90ae51996b5.webm?t=1768902689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185760/extras/91fecccf7b712bc438f1d90ae51996b5.mp4?t=1768902689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>&quot;Under the Sky World&quot; is an orthodox casual RPG game.<br>Players are in the era of the popular virtual world,<br>One day, by chance, I entered the most popular game &quot;Under the Sky World&quot;!<br>When I entered, I accidentally found that the game was invaded by a virus.<br>Players need to find evil hackers and stop this virtual world from being destroyed!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185760/extras/8eff6499bb79bcd16233db3132f799ee.poster.avif?t=1768902689\" width=600 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185760/extras/8eff6499bb79bcd16233db3132f799ee.webm?t=1768902689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2185760/extras/8eff6499bb79bcd16233db3132f799ee.mp4?t=1768902689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>KARIN</strong><br>It is Karine's avatar in SW, with cheating item given by her father.<br>When she was playing, she found that SW was invaded by hackers. <br>Can KARIN successfully save the world?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https: